-    // E-ink (Bigme HiBreak Pro): sharpen the composed frame for a panel that shows only black
-    // and white. Each pixel looks at the darkest and lightest value around it (two rings of six
-    // taps, at einkEnhanceRadius and twice that, in pixels). Where that range is large (from
+    // E-ink (Bigme HiBreak Pro): the settings that the render pass below shares across its
