-    // Afterwards the greys between einkBlack and einkWhite are stretched over the full range
-    // (text contrast; 0 and 1 = off). Done here and not with the colour transform, so that the
-    // enhancement still sees light hairlines that the stretch turns white.
+    // whichever it is nearer, so anti-aliased edges become hard and wide strokes stay solid.
+    // einkGate0/1: only where most taps sit on one of the two sides (text and lines on a flat
